---
// STOPPED OUT loss-cut Easter egg (Kurumi's forced-loss-cut beat, RB
// version). A 120vh overscroll zone past the loop band drives a
// scroll-depth fade — dark navy + grid, then full black that holds —
// and one more scroll cuts in a ~1.6s splash (RetailBo wordmark, the
// pointing armored RB + the trading-room scene, big crimson STOPPED
// OUT stamp), then the page snaps back to the hero. Replays every
// time. Fade depth is driven by scroll distance, never a timer.
// Skipped entirely under reduced motion (see HomeScripts).
// Splash art: the sampler's existing pointing-RB + room-scene images.
---

<div class="b-loss-zone" id="bLossZone" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="b-loss-veil" id="bLossVeil" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="b-loss-navy" id="bLossNavy"></div>
  <div class="b-loss-black" id="bLossBlack"></div>
</div>
<div
  class="b-loss-splash"
  id="bLossSplash"
  role="img"
  aria-label="RetailBo — stopped out. RB pointing at you beside the trading room scene, under a large STOPPED OUT stamp."
>
  <div class="b-loss-mark">Retail<span>Bo</span></div>
  <div class="b-loss-imgs">
    <img class="b-loss-img-point" src="/assets/bo-rb-pointing.webp" alt="" />
    <img class="b-loss-img-room" src="/assets/bo-rb-trading-room.webp" alt="" />
  </div>
  <div class="b-loss-stamp">Stopped Out</div>
</div>
